\f2\b\fs26 \cf3 \ul \ulc3 Overview
\f0\b0 \cf0 \ulnone \
\

\fs24 There are four folders in this package: \
\\Data: All experimental data exported from zTree. Furthermore, some interim data files that are created using the code files in the package and that are used elsewhere in the code files, included to help test each code file separately. \
\\Code: All code files including Mathematica, R, and Stata files. \
\\Instructions: The original (French) versions and English translations of the experimental instructions that are read aloud and distributed to the subjects. The Appendix A includes the one with chat in English only. \
\\zTree: zTree program used in the experiments, which is designed using z-Tree version 3.5.1, based on the program used in Potters and Suetens, ReStud, 2009.
\f2\b\fs28 \

\f0\b0\fs24 \

