\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \ulnone The experimental data are automatically exported from zTree. They are saved in the form: Date_Time.xls \
In certain instances Date_Time_.xls are created, because some of the codes (in particular, package updates (zTree) along the way) required resaving the data in a different encoding. The content of the data are untouched during this creation process. \
The data folder includes some other interim data files that are produced while running the code files below. These are described below as well. 
