\f2\b\fs26 \cf10 \ul \ulc10 Follow this sequence for replication\
\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \ulnone In all code files, detailed comments are added to help replication. This includes descriptions for the computed values that are not presented in tables or figures. In certain instances, the replicating reader needs to alter parameter values (such as Comp for the strategic environment and Chat for the communication treatments). These are described in the code.\
\
All required packages are explicitly called in the code files. Additionally Code\\R_pack_versions.txt is listing all the R packages that are used with their relevant versions. \
\
Before running a code file, make sure to set the working directory as the Data folder. \
